[size=4][b]What[/b][/size]

[size=3]Takes the guesswork out of alchemy by showing what a combination will produce before you craft it.[/size]

[list]
[*][size=3][b]Result preview on the alchemy workbenches[/b] - both tiers of the alchemy workbench show what your chosen ingredients will make as soon as they form a real recipe. Other stations are not changed.[/size]
[*][size=3][b]Failed mixes are not previewed[/b] - the game picks their result at random each time, so there is nothing fixed to show.[/size]

[*][size=3][b]Refill your last mix[/b] - press a hotkey (default R) at either alchemy workbench to load the ingredients you used there last time, pulled from your inventory, instead of picking each one again. There's a controller button and an auto-fill-when-you-open-it toggle as well. Works for deliberate failure mixes just as well as real recipes.[/size]
[/list]

[size=3]Unlock path: the mod works as soon as you have either alchemy workbench. Progression is entirely the game's normal tech tree. This mod doesn't add or gate any features behind perks.[/size]

[size=4][b]Other mods of mine you might like[/b][/size]

[list]
[*][size=3][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/graveyardkeeper/mods/86]Decomp Delight[/url] — shows what element (Chaos, Life, etc.) each item decomposes into in the mill / mixer / distillation cube. Natural companion to Alchemy Research Redux.[/size]
[*][size=3][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/graveyardkeeper/mods/57]Queue Everything[/url] — queue batches of alchemy crafts. QE's per-workbench auto-craft also covers the alchemy workbench.[/size]
[*][size=3][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/graveyardkeeper/mods/62]Where's Ma' Storage[/url] — shared inventory across workstations means alchemy ingredients are accessible from every bench.[/size]
[*][size=3][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/graveyardkeeper/mods/65]FasterCraft Reloaded[/url] — speed up alchemy crafting.[/size]
[/list]

[size=4][b]Configuration[/b][/size]

[size=3]If you installed the required [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/graveyardkeeper/mods/79]Graveyard Keeper BepInEx 5 Pack[/url] and this mod is configurable, press F1 in-game to open the config interface.[/size]

[size=4][b]Requirements[/b][/size]

[list]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/graveyardkeeper/mods/79][size=3]Graveyard Keeper BepInEx 5 Pack at Graveyard Keeper Nexus - Mods and community (nexusmods.com)[/size][/url]
[/list]
[size=4][b]Compatibility[/b][/size]

[size=3]Built and tested against the latest Windows Steam build of Graveyard Keeper. Other storefronts and platforms aren't extensively tested — should generally work, but YMMV.[/size]

[size=4][b]Installation[/b][/size]

[size=3]Installation using Vortex is the recommended installation method. If you wish to install manually, extract the contents of the mod archive into:[/size]

[code]...\steamapps\common\Graveyard Keeper\BepInEx[/code]

